        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS4030BU32D,  4\" x 3\" Heavy Duty Grade Satin Stainless Steel Hinge with 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch x 3 Inch Stainless Steel Hinge with 2 Ball Bearings has a satin stainless steel finish. It is .119 inches thick. It features a stainless steel hinge pin that is removable. The 4 x 3 Ball Bearing Stainless Steel Hinge comes packaged with 2 hinges and matching wood screws. It has a standard template hole pattern. Deltana SS4030BU32D has square corners.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS4030BU-specifications.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"519\" height=\"331\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS4030BU32D Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 x 3 Satin Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.119\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings: 2BB\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10  x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS4030BU-specifications.pdf?v=1704262339\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS4030BU Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
